  "description": "HarvestAI is a .NET library for scraping, crawling, and cleaning web content for LLM and RAG pipelines. Scrapes JavaScript-heavy sites with Playwright/Chromium, converts HTML to clean Markdown, and splits output into token-aware chunks sized for your model's context window. Supports authenticated sessions (cookie/login carryover), recursive site crawling with concurrency control, and localizing CDN-gated images so links never expire. Ideal for building RAG ingestion pipelines, AI dataset prep, and LLM-ready web content extraction.",
